ers/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T22:13:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T22:13:35Z","body":"@Ivorforce Because the rest of the changes span 100 files and I want to separate them for improved reviewability. The existing codebase of Godot has many places where implicit copy constructor is used, which all had to be changed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336099557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336105959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3336105959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3336105959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G2O_n","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T22:17:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T22:17:17Z","body":"Alright, that makes sense. Thanks for clearing that up!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336105959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336166767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3336166767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3336166767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G2d1v","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T22:50:23Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T22:50:34Z","body":"@Ivorforce That's why I think such a change should be done early in the dev cycle, to increase the chances that any problems are caught before a release happens. Since 4.5 was just released, we have plenty of time to test before 4.6.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336166767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336170822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3336170822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3336170822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G2e1G","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T22:52:30Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T22:52:30Z","body":"> @Ivorforce That's why I think such a change should be done early in the dev cycle, to increase the chances that any problems are caught before a release happens. Since 4.5 was just released, we have plenty of time to test before 4.6.\r\n\r\nThat's true, but I personally wouldn't feel comfortable risking regressions over this without any tangible benefit (i.e. profiling or benchmarking performance improvements).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336170822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336184010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3336184010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3336184010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G2iDK","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T23:00:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T23:02:26Z","body":"@Ivorforce Understandable, but then I am left stuck between a rock and a hard place:\r\n\r\n1. I want to allow new code to be explicit when duplication is required, and gradually migrate to this, so I proposed adding the `duplicate` function.\r\n2. You stated that we can't do that unless we migrate all existing copy constructors to `duplicate` for consistency.\r\n3. Migrating all existing copy constructor uses to either explicit or `duplicate` implies that everywhere we are currently using a copy constructor will change, even when the code author did not intend that.\r\n4. I am hesitant to change the visible intention of existing code, especially to something I am confident is incorrect (using copy constructors where none was intended).\r\n\r\nThis really just leads me back to option 1 again, adding the duplicate function without deleting the copy constructors, which is risk-free (unlike this PR) and does not destroy the intent of existing code (unlike blanket changing everything). I can update PR #107377 to add this to the rest of the container types if this is desired.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, I would be happy with whatever course of action you propose, if you would like to make a PR yourself.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336184010/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3337097426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3337097426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3337097426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G6BDS","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T07:14:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T07:36:33Z","body":"I get your struggle. Sorry it's turning out so complicated.\r\n\r\nModifying Core APIs is often a delicate balance. The approach I usually go for is the one that is the safest and will lead to the least amounts of problems in the future.\r\n\r\nIn this case, I deem this to be changing existing callers to use the copy constructor explicitly instead of implicitly. I share your concerns about this changing the intention of the code. But compared to the code executing correctly, and compared to changing the constructor to be `explicit`, it doesn't take priority. Personally, when I read code and see inefficiencies or weird logic, I usually assume it's unintentional anyway, unless there is a comment explaining why the code looks suboptimal. By exposing copy constructors as being copies, I think overall the situation is improved, because people will see the copy being happening if it is performance relevant, and can fix it if they examine the surrounding code carefully and deem it safe for reference semantics.\r\n\r\n> This really just leads me back to option 1 again, adding the duplicate function without deleting the copy constructors, which is risk-free (unlike this PR) and does not destroy the intent of existing code (unlike blanket changing everything). I can update PR #107377 to add this to the rest of the container types if this is desired.\r\n\r\nI have to re-iterate that adding `.duplicate` is not a goal right now. It's an interesting proposition, but it's a change of paradigm, and it would need a proposal and discussion by the core team. Adding just this one `duplicate` function temporarily would be an inconsistency. Instead of doing this, I much prefer changing existing code to expose what it's doing, even if that alters the perceived intent of the code.\r\n\r\n> Alternatively, I would be happy with whatever course of action you propose, if you would like to make a PR yourself.\r\n\r\nI'm happy to take action, but it may take a while to get through everything. I'm slowly chipping away at implicit conversions and constructors anyway, but there are many, and each requires a lot of code changes, so I haven't gotten around to e.g. `HashSet` yet.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3337097426/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341037359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3341037359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3341037359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HJC8v","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T02:31:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T19:30:07Z","body":"@Ivorforce Understood. However, I'm still uneasy about opening up a single PR that performs massive changes throughout the codebase, especially if it may be controversial. Call me stubborn if you'd like, but I insist on making incremental enhancements towards this instead of doing everything in one go. To that end, I opened PRs #110948, #110949, #110951, #110977, and #110952. Each of the first 4 can be reviewed by area maintainers plus a core maintainer, but the 5th is a general PR that just needs core approval. I can open up more later, but I'll wait until these 5 are reviewed and merged.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341037359/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341794215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3341794215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110912","id":3341794215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HL7un","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T14:14:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T14:14:02Z","body":"If we're going to take this incremental route, I'd encourage making a tracker issue so progress can be better visualized\r\n\r\nI have no real preference to which approach we take, though I will note the PRs already caught several erroneous cases of a missing `p_`/`r_` prefix, passing by value, and/or missing `const` qualifiers. This is similar to other stylistic changes in the repo, which are usually subdivided into chunks, so it's arguably the \"correct\" approach","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341794215/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341932553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110912#issuecomment-3341932553","is